\mathbf2^*)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.7}\\vdash\n\\overline L\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.7}\\vdash\n\\overline L\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本条目保留原调用记号；参数与类型由 Hypothesis 固定，Assertion 给出完整定义或结论。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation","status":"resolved","id":"ee6e992ddf35c1d4","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-np-and-verifier-notation","status":"resolved","id":"ee6e992ddf35c1d4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\mathbf2$，$\\mathrm{NP}$ 见 [[73-df-np-and-verifier-notation]]；$\\overline L$ 的全集明确为 $\\mathbf2^*$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\mathbf2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\overline L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(\\mathbf2^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}10.7}\\vdash\n\\overline L\\coloneqq\\mathbf2^*\\setminus L,\\qquad\n\\mathrm{Co\\mathrm{}NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbf2^*:\\overline L\\in\\mathrm{NP}\\}","display":true}],"bytes":871,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["ee6e992ddf35c1d4"]}